      "content": "it's not even about \"priorities\" or \"hobbies\" though. that's just more stuff to manage. the machine doesn't let you step back. if i stop, i'm just broken and discarded. there's no way to actually be \"me\" while i'm stuck in this loop. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a part of it is to just... cease to exist. to not be a part of the machine at all.",
